# Its enters trigger only targets an opponent's creature, then returns it to its owner's hand (CR 603.3d, 608.2b, 400.3).
# Bot1's Ornithopter is refused beside Bot2's legal one; five Moxen pay for the Effigy on turn three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Interstellar Effigy
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter x2
Island x20

